Show your notification feed (arrivals, completions, trade events, ...)

Usage:
  keryx notifications [flags]

Examples:
  keryx notifications
  keryx notifications --unread
  keryx notifications --all
  keryx notifications --kind UnitArrived
  keryx notifications --exclude BuildComplete
  keryx notifications --mark-read

Flags:
      --all              include every notification kind without grouping (latest 100)
      --exclude string   hide these notification kinds (comma-separated)
  -h, --help             help for notifications
      --kind string      only show these notification kinds (comma-separated, e.g. UnitArrived)
      --mark-read        mark all notifications as read and exit
      --unread           show only unread notifications

Global Flags:
  -j, --json   output as JSON (for scripts and MCP)
